---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Résumé — DJ Welker"
  description="DJ Welker — creative systems designer, builder, and founder. York, PA + remote. Operator + builder + founder."
  type="profile"
  current="resume"
  printNav={true}
>
<style slot="head">
.rwrap{max-width:840px;margin:0 auto;padding:44px 28px 80px}
.rhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);padding-bottom:16px}
.rhead h1{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.2rem);letter-spacing:-.03em}
.rhead .role{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:6px}
.rmeta{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.9;text-align:right;color:var(--ink2)}
.rsec{margin-top:30px}
.rsec h2{font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.1rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:6px;margin-bottom:12px}
.rsec p{font-size:1rem;color:var(--ink2);margin-bottom:8px}
.rrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2.4fr;gap:16px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.rrow:first-of-type{border-top:none}
.rrow .k{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600}
.rrow .k small{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:400;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)}
.rrow .v{font-size:.96rem;color:var(--ink2)}
.rcols{columns:2;column-gap:34px;font-size:.95rem}
@media(max-width:600px){.rcols{columns:1}.rrow{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.printbtn{margin-top:8px}
@media print{
  .nav,.printbtn,footer{display:none!important}
  body{background:#fff;color:#000;font-size:11pt}
  .rwrap{max-width:100%;padding:0}
  a{color:#000;text-decoration:none}
  .rhead .role,.accent{color:#000!important}
  .rsec{margin-top:16px}
}
</style>
<main id="main">

<div class="rwrap">
  <div class="rhead">
    <div><h1>Daniel "DJ" Welker</h1><div class="role">Creative systems designer · Builder · Founder</div></div>
    <div class="rmeta">
      <div><a href="mailto:ceodjwelker@gmail.com">ceodjwelker@gmail.com</a></div>
      <div><a href="tel:+17178814960">(717) 881-4960</a></div>
      <div>York, PA · Remote</div>
      <div><a href="https://instagram.com/dj.welker">@dj.welker</a> · <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dj-welker">LinkedIn</a> · <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@dj.welker">TikTok</a></div>
      <div><a href="https://djwelker.com">djwelker.com</a> · <a href="https://ce-os.com">ce-os.com</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="rsec">
    <h2>Summary</h2>
    <p>Founder and builder with hands-on experience across operations, customer service, e-commerce, marketing, and brand building. I make brands, websites, and tools, and I run real operations — turning an unclear business, brand, or idea into something organized, attractive, and built to move, designed as one connected system. Founder of CE OS — a creative + production studio and systems builder (ce-os.com) — plus a portfolio of self-built product ventures. Operator, builder, and founder — one person, start to finish.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="rsec">
    <h2>Selected work</h2>
    <div class="rrow"><div class="k">Titanium Detailing<small>Client · York, PA · live · 5.0★</small></div><div class="v">Full digital build for a mobile detailing business: brand, a 21-page mobile site (12 local city pages) that books by text, and Titanium OS — a private daily control center. Invisible to bookable in about a week. Client-owned.</div></div>
    <div class="rrow"><div class="k">CE OS<small>Studio + products · active · ce-os.com</small></div><div class="v">Founder-run creative + production studio and systems builder: brand, video, AI creative, websites, and the operations underneath them. 100+ productized deliverables from $29, most shipping in 48h, client-owned files. One verified paying client (Titanium), plus a portfolio of in-house products.</div></div>
    <div class="rrow"><div class="k">TSO Resale<small>Venture · 100+ sales · 4.65★</small></div><div class="v">Curated vintage plus one-of-one custom apparel on Depop and Grailed. Sourcing, photography, listing copy, pricing, and customers — built to 100+ sales at a 4.65★ rating.</div></div>
    <div class="rrow"><div class="k">Top Flavorz Grill<small>Client · Carlisle, PA · delivered</small></div><div class="v">A full Viral Instagram Brand &amp; Content Guide — positioning, a 5-part viral formula, owned content series, and a 30-day launch, with an approved logo system.</div></div>
    <div class="rrow"><div class="k">AUXTION · LIFTWAVE · Shiftly · STAKE · PLUG<small>Own products / concepts</small></div><div class="v">Self-built product ventures: a paid song-request app on Stripe Connect, a browser DJ platform, an hourly-business operations OS, a real-estate acquisition OS, and a TikTok Shop content engine.</div></div>
    <div class="rrow"><div class="k">ScrollStop · CARBYN · Thrown After<small>Ventures + a side app</small></div><div class="v">A TikTok-first Shopify store and a music/nightlife artist brand — plus Thrown After, a community discovery app built as a side project (shelved, rebuilding on iOS). Each built and run on the same system.</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="rsec">
    <h2>Experience</h2>
    <div class="rrow"><div class="k">Founder &amp; Creative Director — CE OS<small>2026 — Present</small></div><div class="v">Full-service creative studio: branding, web, marketing, content, photography, and events. Client management and end-to-end project delivery.</div></div>
    <div class="rrow"><div class="k">Founder — Thrown After<small>2026 · side app</small></div><div class="v">Built and launched a community events/opportunity app end to end as a side project; now shelved and being rebuilt as a native iOS app.</div></div>
    <div class="rrow"><div class="k">Founder — TSO Resale<small>2024 — Present</small></div><div class="v">Custom one-of-one apparel and curated resale on Depop and Grailed. 100+ sales, 4.65★.</div></div>
    <div class="rrow"><div class="k">Assistant Manager — Store Space Self Storage<small>May 2026 — Present</small></div><div class="v">Operations, accounts, rentals, payments, sales targets, and facility management.</div></div>
    <div class="rrow"><div class="k">Assistant Store Manager — Rutter's<small>2026</small></div><div class="v">Staff leadership, inventory, cash handling, merchandising, and daily operations.</div></div>
    <div class="rrow"><div class="k">Team Member — Sheetz<small>Sep 2025 — Mar 2026</small></div><div class="v">Food and beverage prep, POS, cash handling, and customer service.</div></div>
    <div class="rrow"><div class="k">Dietary / Laundry Aide — Lucent (Pleasant Acres)<small>Jun 2023 — Sep 2025</small></div><div class="v">Meal preparation, sanitation, laundry operations, organization, and teamwork.</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="rsec">
    <h2>Capabilities</h2>
    <div class="rcols">
      <p><b>Brand &amp; creative:</b> identity systems, logo design, art direction, graphic design, menus &amp; print, short-form video, pitch decks.</p>
      <p><b>Web &amp; software:</b> websites, web apps, internal tools, portals, e-commerce, booking systems, business operating systems.</p>
      <p><b>Automation &amp; AI:</b> workflow automation, CRM pipelines, email/SMS flows, AI chatbot/receptionist, custom AI workflows.</p>
      <p><b>Growth:</b> local SEO + Google Business, review engines, social content, email/SMS marketing, paid social, funnels.</p>
      <p><b>E-commerce:</b> Shopify, product/listing systems, Depop/Grailed/eBay resale, Klaviyo flows, dropship ops.</p>
      <p><b>Operations:</b> SOPs, ops audits, dashboards, fractional digital ops, whole-business OS builds.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="rsec">
    <h2>Stack</h2>
    <div class="rcols" style="columns:1;font-size:.92rem">
      <p><b>Design &amp; creative:</b> Figma · Adobe Creative Cloud (Photoshop, Illustrator, Premiere, After Effects) · Adobe Firefly · Canva · Three.js / WebGL.</p>
      <p><b>Build &amp; web:</b> Astro · React · Next.js · TypeScript / JavaScript · HTML / CSS · Tailwind · Python · Node · PWA.</p>
      <p><b>Hosting &amp; data:</b> Vercel · Netlify · Cloudflare · Supabase · GitHub.</p>
      <p><b>Commerce:</b> Shopify · Klaviyo · Stripe / Stripe Connect.</p>
      <p><b>AI &amp; content:</b> ChatGPT · Claude · Gamma · Higgsfield · ElevenLabs · custom LLM workflows.</p>
      <p><b>CRM &amp; growth:</b> HubSpot · Apollo · Nimble · Instagram · TikTok · Meta &amp; Google Ads · Local SEO + Google Business Profile.</p>
      <p><b>Ops &amp; productivity:</b> Notion · Airtable · monday.com · Asana · Zapier · Google Workspace (Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Sheets) · Slack · Calendly · Miro · Lucid · Zoom.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="rsec">
    <h2>Education &amp; Leadership</h2>
    <div class="rrow"><div class="k">Dallastown Area High School<small>High School Diploma · Honor Roll</small></div><div class="v">Graduated early (two semesters ahead).</div></div>
    <div class="rrow"><div class="k">Scouts BSA<small>Senior Patrol Leader</small></div><div class="v">Youth leadership. Self-taught builder; considering online business/entrepreneurship education.</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="rsec">
    <h2>Based</h2>
    <p>York, Pennsylvania — working locally and remote. Direct builder access, no agency layers. References available on request.</p>
  </div>
  <button class="btn btn--accent printbtn" onclick="window.print()">Print / Save as PDF <span class="ar">↗</span></button>
</div>
</main>
<footer style="padding:30px 0"><div class="wrap"><div style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;opacity:.7">© 2026 DJ Welker · <a href="/">Home</a></div></div></footer>

</Base>
